{"2006330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fungiman", "steam_appid": 2006330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<strong>Fungiman is an atmospheric and challenging first person survival horror game.</strong><br><br>You find yourself in the forest, as in fifty thousand billion other games. You admire nature, beautiful flowers, trees and mineshafts and do not even suspect that &quot;He&quot;, the warden of the Fungar forest, the Füngiman, has been watching you all this time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/6f873d39cc0e0da2083ca98cf36fff7a.poster.avif?t=1739609981\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/6f873d39cc0e0da2083ca98cf36fff7a.webm?t=1739609981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/6f873d39cc0e0da2083ca98cf36fff7a.mp4?t=1739609981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Why is he following you? He makes sure that no one touches his donuts — the main source of his füngus power. But you also need these donuts, simply because you are a human, and these donuts are <i><strong>really</strong></i> delicious. And you want to collect and eat them all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/644ee4ff6e594a91e6adfece024f0884.poster.avif?t=1739609981\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/644ee4ff6e594a91e6adfece024f0884.webm?t=1739609981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/644ee4ff6e594a91e6adfece024f0884.mp4?t=1739609981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It would seem that the Füngus will be angry if you eat his donuts... <strong>or not?</strong><br><br><strong><u>Features:</u></strong><br>• Füngiman changes his behavior and tactics throughout the game<br>• Two levels: classic and reworked<br>• Diverse locations<br>• Secret minigames<br>• Multiplayer", "about_the_game": "<strong>Fungiman is an atmospheric and challenging first person survival horror game.</strong><br><br>You find yourself in the forest, as in fifty thousand billion other games. You admire nature, beautiful flowers, trees and mineshafts and do not even suspect that &quot;He&quot;, the warden of the Fungar forest, the Füngiman, has been watching you all this time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/6f873d39cc0e0da2083ca98cf36fff7a.poster.avif?t=1739609981\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/6f873d39cc0e0da2083ca98cf36fff7a.webm?t=1739609981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/6f873d39cc0e0da2083ca98cf36fff7a.mp4?t=1739609981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Why is he following you? He makes sure that no one touches his donuts — the main source of his füngus power. But you also need these donuts, simply because you are a human, and these donuts are <i><strong>really</strong></i> delicious. And you want to collect and eat them all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006330/extras/644ee4ff6e594a91e6adfece024f0884.poster.avif?t=1739609981\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass